{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3d619042-6bad-8a87-b7eb-b834949c643d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T14:50:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Duarte",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:48:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:48:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. This is Jorge Duarte. I am calling about my water and sewer bill. It is too high this quarter, much too high."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:49:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can look into that. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "252 Ocean Avenue. Two five two. Wait, one moment, I step outside. My wife is sleeping, she work night shift last night, so I do not want to wake her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:49:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I am outside now. So, the bill. Last quarter was normal. This one is almost double. Double. We did not change anything at home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:49:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see the account. The latest reading is noticeably higher than the previous period. Have you noticed any running toilets or leaks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:49:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No leak. I check already. Nothing running. So I think the reading is wrong, or maybe estimate. I am not happy about this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:49:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I can't tell from here whether it was an estimate or a true read. I can have someone in the meter division review it and see if a re-read is needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:49:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please do that. And I need a copy of the bill, a duplicate, by email. The paper one I put somewhere, I cannot find."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:49:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What email address would you like it sent to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:50:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you use the one already on the account? I do not want to say it on the phone, outside, with the wind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:50:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll send it to the address on file. You should have it shortly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:50:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. One more question. I am in my fifties, my wife also, and money is tight now. Is there any discount for low income or elderly households? For water and sewer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:50:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There may be something along those lines, but I don't have the details in front of me. I'll ask the billing supervisor and note it on your request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:50:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can someone call me back with the answer? Four zero one, five five five, zero one six two. Zero one six two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:50:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0162. We'll call you back, and you'll have the duplicate bill by email today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:50:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
